# CLAUDE.md — <module / service name>

> **Sub-template.** Per-module standing instructions. Claude Code reads
> CLAUDE.md files **additively** walking up the tree — this file's content
> stacks on top of the repo-root `CLAUDE.md`. Keep it short (≤60 lines)
> and scoped to what differs from root.
>
> When to add one: a service, package, or directory has its own test
> command, lint config, conventions, or domain quirks that the root file
> would muddy if it tried to cover them. See
> [`<path-to-hornero>/playbooks/claude-md-layering.md`](<path-to-hornero>/playbooks/claude-md-layering.md)
> for the layering pattern.

