## Local commands

Only commands that differ from the root file. Override root defaults; don't
restate them.

- Test (this module only): `<command>`
- Lint (this module only): `<command>`
- Type check (this module only): `<command>`
- Dev server / runner: `<command>`

## Local conventions

Anything specific to this module that the root file doesn't capture. Examples:

- File / folder naming patterns that diverge from repo norms
- Mock-vs-real-fixture policy for tests here
- Domain glossary terms used in this module's code
- Public API surface — what's exported vs. internal

## Local stack-specific reminders

Each line should reference a real past incident, not abstract advice.

- <e.g., "Don't touch the generated `proto/*.ts` files — regenerated on every CI run">

## Out of scope

What the root CLAUDE.md covers; do not duplicate here:

- Branch hygiene, commit policy → root
- Model selection → root
- Dispatcher / role-and-skill behaviour → root + [`<path-to-hornero>/DISPATCHER.md`]
- Subagent spawning → root
